# P11 U2a (docs/phase11-brief.md 3.5): the no-code path. Move the limit,
# SELECT to Enter Combination, MENU accepts with no code: the limit is
# set and applied at once (trace "vlimit set=-60 code=0 applied=-60"; P15's
# volume curve: 46 clicks down from +6 dB is step 1, -60 dB; the
# output volume drops to the new limit without touching the wheel),
# and reopening Volume Limit goes straight to the limit screen (no code),
# with the triangle where it was left. PLAY on that screen previews (the
# queue plays or pauses); MENU leaves with nothing saved.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p11-vlimit-menu.script
# golden: skip limit_set limit_reopened limit_cancelled
wait 4000

wheel +3 300            # Settings
wait 400
key SELECT 50
wait 1200
wheel +5 300            # Volume Limit
wait 600
key SELECT 50
wait 1500
wheel -46 40            # below the current volume (-60 < -25): clamps at once
wait 600
key SELECT 50           # Enter Combination
wait 800
key MENU 50             # accept with no code
wait 1200
shot limit_set          # back in Settings
key SELECT 50           # reopen: the limit screen (no code)
wait 1500
shot limit_reopened     # the triangle where it was left
wheel -10 40
wait 500
shot limit_moved_again
key MENU 50             # leave: nothing saved
wait 1200
key SELECT 50
wait 1500
shot limit_cancelled    # the triangle is back at the saved limit

quit
